     COMMAND
          cmsg - display text on command line
     
     SYNTAX
          CMSG [text]
     
     DESCRIPTION
          The CMSG command, primarily used in macros, displays 'text' on the
          command line.
          The cursor is placed after the last character displayed.
     
     COMPATIBILITY
          XEDIT: Compatible.
          KEDIT: Compatible.
     
     SEE ALSO
          <EMSG>, <MSG>
     
     STATUS
          Complete.



